            event: "branch_if_18",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$explorer.id",
            text: _("Whoa. This place is hot."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$explorer.id",
            text: _("This cavern is so hot it’s stifling; I can already feel my armor heating up. If we tarry here too long we’ll roast alive. I don’t even want to think about what would happen if I tried to walk across the lava. On the other hand, the lava does light up the cavern nicely. I’m just thankful the trolls constructed a bridge across the lava."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Troll High Shaman",
            text: _("They have broken through the outer guard-line. Destroy the bridge, they must not pass!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "rumble.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "flame-big.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Qlf^Yl",
            cells: "15,19;16,21;17,19;17,18;18,19;18,18;19,18;19,16;20,16;21,16;21,15;22,16;22,15;22,14;23,15;23,14;23,13",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$explorer.id",
            text: _("Uh, I take that back. Still, the trolls don’t seem to be advancing. I guess they think the lava can hold us back. Well, we’ll show them. It will take more than a little heat to stop us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Any unit that ends its turn on a lava hex, except those who can fly over the lava, will take $lava_damage damage at the beginning of the next turn. This lava damage can kill units. Flying units will just take $heat_damage damage per turn when flying over lava, though they too can die if they spend too much time over it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Also, because of the heat in the cavern, all units on cave floor hexes will take $heat_damage damage at the start of each turn. This heat damage can reduce a unit to 1 hit point, but, unlike the lava damage, the heat damage can’t kill the unit."),
          },
        ],
      },
